  "answer_text": "Here's a roundup of the **best laptop deals online right now** across different categories and budgets:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\uded2 Where to Shop for the Best Laptop Deals\n\nYou can find all kinds of deals across a wide range of online retailers such as **Newegg, Walmart, Best Buy, Amazon**, and more. However, it's also recommended to check out deals directly from laptop manufacturers like **Lenovo, HP, and Dell**.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcbb Top Laptop Deals Right Now\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfc6 **Lenovo Yoga 2-in-1 (Best Overall)**\nFeaturing a **14-inch 2880\u00d71800 OLED display** with HDR and up to 120Hz, powered by an **Intel Core Ultra 7 258V CPU, 32GB RAM, 1TB SSD**, and Intel Arc 140V graphics \u2014 this Yoga is easily one of the best Windows laptops available right now. It weighs under three pounds, lasts up to **23 hours** on battery, and features a 2-in-1 form factor that flips all the way around for tablet or tent use.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83d\udcb0 **Dell 15 Laptop (Best Budget Pick)**\nNeed an affordable laptop for basic tasks? The **Dell 15** is a great choice. Its AMD Ryzen 3 7320U chip is well-suited for daily tasks like browsing, streaming, and email.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83c\udfae **RTX 5060 Lenovo Gaming Laptop (Best Gaming Deal)**\nThis **RTX 5060 Lenovo gaming laptop** features an OLED display, Intel Core Ultra 7 chipset, 32GB of RAM, and is currently **$400 off** \u2014 making it one of the best deals of the week.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83c\udf4e **Apple MacBook Air M4/M5 (Best MacBook Deal)**\nSave up to **$300 on the Apple MacBook Air** \u2014 with two unmissable deals on both the **M4 and M5** laptops currently available.\n\n---\n\n### 5. \ud83c\udfae **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16 (Premium Gaming)**\nThe **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16** features a **16\" 2.5K OLED 240Hz display**, Intel Core Ultra 9 285H, 16GB RAM, and **NVIDIA RTX 5070** \u2014 on sale at Best Buy.\n\n---\n\n### 6. \ud83c\udf10 **Acer Chromebook 315 (Best Budget Chromebook)**\n